   "qfep_connection": "The array in motion: bubble sort walking the bars, comparing neighbors, swapping, the largest rising to the end pass after pass. O(n²) and honest about it — the slowest useful sort, chosen here because you can SEE it think. The algorithm made a dance the eye can follow, index against index."
  },
