   "qfep_connection": "Each cyan bar walks left one adjacent swap at a time until an equal-or-smaller neighbor stops it: the sorted region grows by admission, and the only question is how far in each newcomer gets. Its O(n) best case is a quiet bias — the algorithm rewards arrays that were nearly compliant already."
  },
